    <description>Project 790, Requirement 2: when a rep changes a Quote (Proposal)&apos;s standard Status field to &quot;In Review&quot;, stamps Submitted_For_Approval_Date__c (for SLA/aging reporting) and automatically submits it to the Proposal Approval Process so reps don&apos;t have to find and click Submit for Approval manually. Skips entirely (no stamp, no submit) when the Opportunity Owner is exempt (Exempt_From_Proposal_Approval__c, e.g. AMS team) per the escape-route requirement.</description>
